OL,3,GNEWSAFunding to bring extra patrols
OL,4,Atackling knife crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra patrols and new technology aimed
OL,7,Fat targeting knife crime in Derby will
OL,8,Fbe introduced.
OL,10,FIt comes as Derbyshire Police has been
OL,11,Fawarded #387,000 by the Home Office.
OL,13,FAreas of the city will benefit from
OL,14,Fadditional CCTV cameras and knife
OL,15,Fdetection arches, while new systems
OL,16,Fretrieving and analysing data will help
OL,17,Fofficers focus prevention work in
OL,18,Fcertain areas of the city.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
