OL,3,GNEWSAFunding to bring extra patrols
OL,4,Atackling knife crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and Crime Commissioner Nicolle
OL,7,FNdiweni-Roberts said the funding gives
OL,8,Fthe force an opportunity to build on
OL,9,Ftheir ongoing work to "deliver results
OL,10,Fvisibly and quickly".
